          "value": "Matrix([-1,3])"
        },
        {
          "key": "C",
          "text": "(5, 3)",
          "value": "Matrix([5,3])"
        },
        {
          "key": "D",
          "text": "(−4, 6)",
          "value": "Matrix([-4,6])"
        }
      ],
      "answer": "A",
      "solution": "Scale first: (2, 4) − (3, −1) = (−1, 5). Subtracting −1 adds 1.",
